# Every text file is stored AND checked out with LF, on every OS.
#
# Why: the repo's scripts run on Linux (bash, the systemd units, Tofu,
# Kustomize), and a CRLF shebang line fails with "bad interpreter". The
# Windows clone also showed every file as modified when only line endings
# differed (BACKLOG 3.3). A per-clone core.autocrlf fixes one machine; this
# file fixes every clone, and overrides core.autocrlf where it is set.
#
# text=auto lets git detect binaries, so an image added later is left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
